# Google Cloud inventory

## Gate

Use when the user asks which project is active, to list projects/resources,
or to resolve a named GCP id. Prefer Google Cloud MCP; else `gcloud`.

## Defaults

1. Resolve project with `gcloud config get-value project` / MCP equivalent
   before mutate — never guess a project id.
2. Prefer list/describe over create when the ask is “what do we have”.
3. State project + region/zone in receipts when relevant.
4. Do not switch the active project unless the user named the target.

## Refuse

- Do not invent billing accounts or org ids.
- Do not dump full `gcloud auth` token material into chat.
